          "androidx.appfunctions.service.PlatformAppFunctionService"
        ],
        "description": [
          "Saves trees as if the planter captured them, using a test image and skipping the camera\n and GPS wait. With no capture session running, the trees go in a new session that is\n ended straight away. If the app is in the capture flow, they are added to that session."
